---
// Testimonials section component
// Displays social proof from successful producers
---

<section id="testimonials" class="w-full bg-white scroll-mt-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
	<div class="section-inner flex flex-col gap-4">
		<div class="text-center flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
			<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900">
				Don't Just Take It From Us
			</h2>
			<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl self-center">
				Read what producers are saying about writing paper with our leads
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"Just closed my first deal with Century Digital. $12,000 APY. The contract owner had twins, so I'm writing two more policies. These leads actually want to protect their principal."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">— Doug N., Independent Producer</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"High intent is there. Three booked appointments, all three picked up, all three got closed. Can't remember the exact AP, but it's somewhere around $10k per contract."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">— Mike H., MDRT Qualifier</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"In first two leads, booked appointments and both were fully intent on buying. With minimal effort, they both instantly approved and made significant purchases. The suitability process was smooth."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">— Brent Lucas, Wealth Manager</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"Easiest appointments I've ever run. Whatever magic you're cooking these leads with, it's working. They're asking about FIAs before I even pitch them."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">— Mike H., Retirement Income Specialist</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"I had an unhealthy client who got declined by the carrier. Already wrote his daughter and am now writing IULs on his son and granddaughter. $4kish APV. FIAs sell themselves when the lead quality is this high."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">— Xander, Independent Agent</div>
			</div>

			<div class="testimonial-box bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-[#93c5fd] hover:border-[#3b82f6] transition-all reveal shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center mb-6">
					<div class="text-yellow-500 text-xl">★★★★★</div>
				</div>
				<p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 italic leading-relaxed">
					"Everything has been so easy. Just took an application on my first appointment! The contract owner was pre-qualified and ready to roll over their 401(k)."
				</p>
				<div class="text-[#1e40af] font-semibold text-base">— Todd S., Financial Advisor</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

